{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
PhotoCraft renders through Vulkan (or OpenGL via EGL as a fallback), so a
Vulkan driver for your GPU is needed: graphics/mesa-dri provides the Mesa
ones (radv, anv, lavapipe).

Open/Save dialogs go through the XDG desktop portal. Install
sysutils/xdg-desktop-portal together with a backend for your desktop
(for example sysutils/xdg-desktop-portal-gtk) and make sure a D-Bus
session bus is running.
EOM
}
